   845	const char* const kDlpackDoc = R"doc(Export this tensor zero-copy as a DLPack capsule (Python array API protocol).
   846	
   847	stream: the CONSUMER's CUDA stream, as a DLPack int. TensorCUDA queues all of its
   848	  work on the legacy default stream.
   849	  * None or 1: the consumer is on the legacy default stream; nothing to do.
   850	  * -1: no synchronization.
   851	  * 2 (per-thread default stream) or any other handle (a cudaStream_t): TensorCUDA
   852	    records a CUDA event on the legacy default stream and makes the consumer's
   853	    stream wait on it before returning, so the consumer sees every TensorCUDA
   854	    write queued so far.
   855	  * 0 is ambiguous under the protocol and raises ValueError.
   856	max_version: None (or major < 1) returns a legacy "dltensor" capsule; (1, x) or
   857	  later returns "dltensor_versioned" (DLPack 1.3 header, flags 0).
